WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.690
We've come far enough that 
we should be safe for now.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.370
Good grief, you were reckless.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.160
K-Kuro?

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.820
It's been a few days since I last saw you,

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.160
though I'm not sure how much 
time has actually passed for you.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:27.580
So, who's that with you?

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:31.310
You've formed a strange party in my absence...

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:31.920
Huh?

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:35.250
Hey!

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.300
Kuro, thank goodness! Kuro!

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:40.620
What's with you?

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.060
You're throwing me off.

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:45.240
Get a hold of yourself, Illya.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.020
Huh?

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:49.290
Illya?

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:50.910
Hey, Illya!

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.380
Illya-san!

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:30.330
<b>Episode 4 
For My Weak Little Sister</b>

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:34.820
Huh?

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:37.050
This is...

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:40.980
A school?

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.230
You're awake?

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:47.600
Bazett-san...

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:52.940
This is the school we've been using as our base.

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:57.400
They told us most of what's 
happened to you up to now.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:01.650
Speaking of which, where's everyone else?

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:03.120
Hold on, you!

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.240
Wait, I said!

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:07.310
Listen to me!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:08.790
Huh?

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:10.490
Illya-san!

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.010
Good morning!

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:15.450
Illya-san, are you a sleepyhead?

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.840
Do kids go to bed early?

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:21.180
I'm an adult, so I'm not sleepy at all!

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:23.050
Why are you so excited?

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.640
There's a lot I could say,
but put some clothes on first!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.530
She just won't wear any.

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:29.140
What's with her?

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:30.810
Kuro...

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:34.860
I only wear... gym uniforms? Nothing else!

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.820
Why are you so stuck on them when 
you can barely remember the name?!

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.820
Huh? Tanaka-san, what about your injuries?

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:45.540
They healed as we watched.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:48.170
Not even scars remain now!

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:51.660
After she took a direct hit 
from a Noble Phantasm?

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.870
Ah, right...

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:59.490
When I couldn't hold off her Noble 
Phantasm with my thaumaturgy,

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:01.890
Tanaka-san shielded me.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:06.350
Hey, Tanaka-san, why did you do that?

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.390
Oh, that?

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:12.350
Well, everything was 
throb-throbby before that.

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:15.310
I got punched, kicked...

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:15.310
<i>That word... Does she mean...</i>

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:19.020
Yes, at the time, I didn't want 
to be throb-throbby anymore.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:24.820
But more than that, I didn't want 
you to be throb-throbby.

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.200
Huh?

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:35.880
I don't think that was "throb-throbby." 
It's called "painful."

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.190
Painful?

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:40.210
Yeah, that's right.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.270
And yet...

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:50.250
Thank you, Tanaka-san.

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:52.250
For what?

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.060
I'm the one who just learned 
the word "painful" from you.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.480
No, not for that...

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:03.390
My goodness, what an impressive experience, 
being used as a gopher.

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:04.900
Gil-kun!

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.960
Here, gym clothes.

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.950
Have that selfish woman put them on.

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:12.070
Everyone's here.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:14.230
Let's get started, then.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.360
To summarize our current situation,

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:20.300
this is the world Miyu comes from.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.260
In other words, we're in a completely 
different, parallel world.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:30.800
<b>Original World           Miyu's World 

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.500
We were most likely thrown

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:30.800
into this world, along with the area several 
hundred meters around the great cavern.

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:36.770
But when I arrived in this world, 
there wasn't anyone around me.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.510
There seems to be a discrepancy of several days

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:41.320
separating everyone's arrivals here.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:43.830
I was alone, as well.

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:45.530
Huh? What about Sapphire?

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:50.780
I've been trying to contact her this whole 
time, but there's no response.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:55.410
I'm certain she was sent to this world, but...

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.120
I see.

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:02.040
Chloe and I were sent here two days ago.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:06.290
Travel to a parallel world falls 
under the scope of sorcery.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:08.840
I'm still finding it hard to believe our situation.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:12.350
The desks aren't big enough for her.

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:16.600
Still, this drives one point home.

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:20.850
Miyu really did live in a parallel world...

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:26.610
From her point of view, you all are the 
ones from a parallel world, though.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:30.010
Gilgamesh-kun, that's a poor classroom attitude!

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.800
Don't be so stiff, Sensei.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:35.540
Good grief...

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:40.500
I still can't believe you're just 
joining us like nothing happened.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.850
I'm not one of you.

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:45.190
We're just temporarily cooperating.

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:48.920
Well, we're allies as long 
as our interests coincide.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:55.340
Miyu's being held captive in the enemy's 
atelier at that crater's center, right?

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:56.950
For sure.

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:00.870
But evidently, the procedures 
to make her function

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:03.260
as the Holy Grail are complicated.

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:06.430
There's no telling when they'll finish them,

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.290
but you might not have much time.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.680
Right now, we know two people 
of the enemy forces.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:21.130
Angelica, who uses the Archer Card, Gilgamesh.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.540
My Card, yeah.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:26.350
Then what's Beatrice's Card?

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:28.880
I can guess that one.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:30.720
It's...

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.730
The God of Thunder, Thor.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.390
The strongest god in Norse mythology.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:38.980
That's also unbelievable.

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:41.090
It's like a nightmare.

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:46.400
I know this sounds hard to believe, 
but that Card's a bit troublesome.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:50.360
Enough so that we have essentially 
no countermeasures against it.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.620
We do have countermeasures.

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.670
Saber, Lancer, Rider.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.560
My mission was to bring these 
back with me, but for now,

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:11.300
I'll entrust you with them.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:15.850
It seems only one of us is currently 
capable of using these Cards.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:20.060
So if we have any hope of 
overcoming this situation,

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:23.340
it lies with you, Illyasviel.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.980
R-Right.

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:37.290
My stomach is sad...

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:40.120
Even asleep, this student's a problem child!

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.830
Let's end our meeting for now.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.030
It's almost time for dinner, isn't it?

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:47.040
But what is there to eat?

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.180
You're okay with delivery, right?

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.480
Delivery?

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.510
What's with that gilded cell phone?

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.600
Shoyu ramen, light on the mapo, for five.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.020
You sure are quick, mister!

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:05.260
But I ordered them without mapo.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:08.060
Illya-san?

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.700
Why are you cowering like a baby sheep?

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:15.360
That's not good! You shouldn't 
draw out my sadism!

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:23.360
It smells like the fat from a pig's back, 
along with fermented soybeans!

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:26.340
<i>I wonder if we could train this girl with food...</i>

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.750
55,000 yen, after tax.

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:30.750
That's the price?

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.210
Will a single gold coin suffice?

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.670
<i>He's totally getting ripped off!</i>

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:43.410
Illya, if you don't eat it fast, 
the noodles will get soggy.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:44.850
Huh?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.570
Sorry, I'm good...

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.430
Someone else can have it.

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:54.530
Ah, hey!

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:02.540
<i>This is the school we attended 
on the other side.</i>

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.740
<i>Its layout is the same, but...</i>

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:10.090
There are posters I've never seen.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:40.500
It's almost completely dark.

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:43.720
But it's bright across the bridge.

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:46.870
Miyama Town is a real ghost town.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:51.130
You think we'll ever be able to go home?

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:53.880
Seeing it like this...

00:10:54.970 --> 00:11:01.220
It makes me realize my home, family, 
and friends are all gone,

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:04.330
whether I like it or not.

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:06.140
Illya-san...

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:09.760
Will I never see them again?

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:13.780
Everyone,

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:14.870
Mama,

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:17.050
Onii-chan...

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:20.550
You never change, do you, wishy-washy Illya?

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:23.220
Kuro...

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:25.830
You've been spacing out for a while.

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:30.540
It's pretty complacent of you to 
wimp out at a time like this.

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:33.000
I'm not wimping out!

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:41.230
I know this is no time for me to be wishy-washy.

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:42.720
But...

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:48.000
After getting sent to this world 
and attacked by enemies...

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:50.600
How can I help it?!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.650
Let me complain a little!

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:56.980
Honestly, you're such a handful.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:07.450
K-Kuro?

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:10.450
Enter Trance, Illya.

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:12.740
I'll cut you into pieces!

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:19.120
S-Stop it, Kuro!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.580
Why are you doing this?

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.100
You have a blade pointed at you right now.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:26.180
Why are you asking the enemy 
why they're attacking you?

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:28.330
If you keep that up, then eventually...

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:29.680
No,

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.390
you'll die here.

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.590
Th-There's no way you can do that!

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:37.110
You have the curse of shared pain.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.970
Oh, that?

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.390
It was supposed to be a deterrent, wasn't it?

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.320
But whatever.

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:46.800
It's gone?!

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:49.240
Now I don't have to hold back!

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:50.490
Illya-san!

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:51.750
I'll cut you to pieces!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.740
What are you?

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.760
What's this all about?

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:01.620
I told you, didn't I?

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:04.760
I'm humanity's oldest hero, Gilgamesh.

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:10.060
Or at least the shadow, or perhaps 
the pale imitation, of him.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.050
I'll change the question.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.560
What are the Cards?

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:18.060
Humanity's greed, maybe?

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:21.610
It's not possible to summon and control

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:25.490
heroes of legend who've 
surpassed the realm of humanity.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:29.530
But the Ainsworths succeeded in the
astounding feat of translating a fraction

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:34.770
of their power into vessels known as "Classes," 
and exchanging those with themselves.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.740
It's a pseudo-summon that 
violates the hero's consent.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:44.730
It's a greed so despicable, conceited, 
and offensive, it's almost charming, isn't it?

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.970
It's my first time seeing a hero's form.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:52.690
So that's the Class Card, Lancer.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.100
In that case, it's odd.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.400
Why do you possess your will?

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:04.610
Compared to other Heroic Spirits, 
my adult self's ego is a bit too strong.

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:06.990
So?

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:08.560
So?

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:13.370
I think I've covered most of the general stuff...

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.290
It's not enough.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.790
I hope you'll think of that as consideration.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.500
Aren't there plenty of things 
it's better not to know?

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:24.230
I'll tell you when the time comes.

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:25.460
But at the very least,

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:28.660
it won't be before they 
finish their sibling spat.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:33.430
How does it feel to use the wielder of Gáe Bolg,

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:37.500
the great hero of Celtic myth, Cú Chulainn?

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.350
You knew who this Card was?

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.310
Well, yeah.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:44.480
Then stop this now.

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:46.430
You understand, don't you?

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:47.360
This spear...

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.330
Yes.

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:52.520
An unavoidable Noble Phantasm that 
guarantees its strike by reversing causality

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:55.870
to create the result of a pierced 
heart before it's unleashed,

00:14:56.390 --> 00:15:01.380
rendering all attempts to defend or 
dodge it futile once it's activated.

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:04.060
Quite the reliable spear, isn't it?

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:07.130
Why don't you try using it to see if that's true?

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.210
This isn't right, Kuro.

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:11.400
Why are you so angry?

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:12.580
What did I

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.260
ever do to you?!

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:17.430
Stop being a baby!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.290
A bow? This is bad!

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:43.440
Kuro-san's serious!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:46.880
You always, always do that!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.230
Impressive, Rider.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:05.230
Your Agility is top rank.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.110
Just talk to me.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:12.190
I can't understand if you won't tell me!

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:15.160
Is it so wrong to feel a little faint of heart?!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:18.400
I want to save Miyu, too!

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:20.000
I swore I would!

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:22.960
Even now, those feelings haven't changed!

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:25.170
But...

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.270
No one's here, in this world.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.000
Our enemy is too great...

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:33.440
And all I could do was run,

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:35.180
so...

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:38.390
The loneliness she felt, being all 
alone in an unfamiliar world,

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:42.140
and the fear she felt, facing 
overwhelming enemies...

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:45.280
They never crossed Miyu's lips.

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:51.160
The anxiety and fear you feel now

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:54.780
are what Miyu faced in our world.

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:59.030
How hopeless and scared she must have felt...

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:01.680
You can understand it now, right?

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:07.440
But Miyu never revealed 
those feelings to anyone.

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:14.570
If we're to call ourselves her friends, 
then we can't complain.

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:20.280
Not until we rescue Miyu, and she chooses

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:25.020
to complain to us herself.

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.350
That's what you wanted to say, Kuro-san?

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:30.930
Kuro...

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.900
No, not yet.

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:38.740
It's not over yet!

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:41.690
That sword!

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:43.350
I'm not holding back.

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:46.460
If you don't take this seriously, I'll kill you!

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:53.920
Class Card, Saber...

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:04.990
I don't even have to ask your 
identity, King Arthur.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:09.010
Kuro?

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:13.230
Ah, that was a clean break...

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:18.780
I guess all I can make now really 
are hollow imitations.

00:18:22.150 --> 00:18:23.270
Kuro...

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.400
Don't give me that look.

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:27.870
Your holy sword will be sad.

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:33.270
That's the Last Phantasm, woven by 
this planet from humanity's hopes.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:38.370
You're holding the strongest Phantasm 
humanity ever wished for.

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:42.490
I don't care if it's a god's hammer...

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:44.890
Just send it flying!

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:49.000
Because humanity's wishes 
can exceed the gods!

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:50.820
Yeah!

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:53.000
Thanks, Kuro.

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:55.360
I won't complain anymo—

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:58.950
Kuro? Hang in there, Kuro!

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:00.920
What do I do?

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:04.220
Just now, Kuro...

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.810
No... No!

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:12.710
I finally understand...

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:15.500
I...

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:17.280
Kuro...

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:47.650
<i>No... What is this?</i>

00:19:47.650 --> 00:19:49.870
<i>My tongue's... going to melt!</i>

00:19:58.310 --> 00:19:59.860
I'm sorry.

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:03.450
It's been so long since I had a 
treat, I got a bit fired up.

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:06.370
No, no, thank you for the treat!

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:10.260
I've recorded that to my main hard disc,

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:12.350
so let's watch it again later!

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.020
Delete it right now!

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:18.150
And... Kuro, you jerk!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.030
I was really worried about you!

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:22.530
I thought I had cut you down!

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:26.940
I wish you'd learn to gauge 
distance and sensation.

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:28.950
You only cut my sword.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:33.650
Oh, speaking of which, you were about 
to say something before our kiss.

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:34.920
What was it?

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:38.180
Forget it! It doesn't matter, jerk!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.620
Pouting like a child...

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:45.090
Just tell me! Come on, come on!

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:47.510
I can't do anything on my own...

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:52.060
I've always been able to fight 
because someone was with me.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:56.690
I finally recalled that obvious fact.

00:20:57.430 --> 00:21:01.070
So, Kuro, stay with me.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:05.990
I don't want us to be separated anymore.

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:14.540
<i>Illya, the power you possess...</i>

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:19.500
<i>The Cards, Bazett, Gilgamesh...</i>

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:24.010
<i>They're all things you earned by facing them.</i>

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:26.630
<i>You say you can't do anything alone,</i>

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:28.550
<i>that you're a weakling, but...</i>

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:34.980
You can't fight on your own?

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:37.190
That goes for everyone.

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:40.190
Even for Miyu, I'm sure.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:42.010
So, Illya,

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:46.200
make sure you say that line to Miyu, too.

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:49.000
Yeah!

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:35.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:22.540
What's that?

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:24.960
Big baths are great!

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.090
<i>I shouldn't interject my thoughts.</i>

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.470
We only have Tanaka-san's bloomers, though.

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:31.760
I'll do it!

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:34.470
Don't show me to the bathroom, okay?

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:36.490
<b>The Little Lady Attacks</b>
